'''Drumcorps Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and can be unlocked when beating the stage [[Black Hole Rising (Insane)|Dimension of Despair]] appearing every Thursday. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] increases attack power and health, and gains [[Multi-Hit]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 201
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Drumcorps Cat
|name2 = Banner Cat
|name3 = Mochi Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Banner Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Mochi Cat''' when obtained from [[Revenge of Black Hole (Deadly)|Revenge of Black Hole]] (guaranteed to drop) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit can weaken Metal enemies at a 40% chance to 50% attack power for a very long duration. Although not guaranteed, this weaken helps a lot for certain Metal enemies such as [[Sir Metal Seal]] or [[Metal One Horn]] due to their high DPS. Because of his Single Attack, he is not recommended to be used against [[Metal Doge]] or [[Croconator]] swarms.

==='''True Form'''===
It gains 20 more attack power, 3,000 more HP and [[Multi-Hit]], effectively raising his chance to weaken metallic foes to 64%. With this buff, he is now a reliable proc unit for Metals and can give you a lot of breathing room for Metal-heavy stages.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

